---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { blog } from '../config';
import '../styles/editor.css';

const tokenURL = 'https://github.com/settings/personal-access-tokens/new?name=Blog%20editor&description=Edit%20oqwn%2Fwzj-blog%20articles&target_name=oqwn&contents=write&expires_in=7';
---
<BaseLayout title="写作" editor noindex>
  <div class="editor-page" id="editor-app">
    <div class="editor-heading">
      <h1>写作</h1>
      <span id="connection-status">未连接 GitHub</span>
      <button id="disconnect" type="button" hidden>断开连接</button>
    </div>
    <details class="connection" id="connection" open>
      <summary>连接作者账号</summary>
      <p>仅账号 <strong>oqwn</strong> 可保存。令牌只在当前页面使用，关闭后需重新连接。</p>
      <form id="connect-form" autocomplete="off">
        <label for="github-token">GitHub 写入令牌</label>
        <div class="connect-row">
          <input id="github-token" type="password" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" placeholder="粘贴仅限本仓库的令牌" required />
          <button id="connect-button" type="submit">连接 GitHub</button>
        </div>
      </form>
      <details class="token-help">
        <summary>首次如何授权</summary>
        <ol>
          <li>在 GitHub <a href={tokenURL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">创建细粒度令牌</a>。</li>
          <li>Repository access 选择 <strong>Only select repositories</strong>，只勾选 <strong>wzj-blog</strong>。</li>
          <li>Contents 设为 <strong>Read and write</strong>，设置短期有效期，生成后粘贴到上方。</li>
        </ol>
        <p>令牌相当于钥匙，请勿写进文章或发给他人。可随时在 GitHub 撤销授权。此编辑器不会请求修改工作流的权限。</p>
      </details>
    </details>
    <div class="file-toolbar">
      <label for="post-select">文章</label>
      <select id="post-select"><option value="">新文章</option></select>
      <button id="new-post" type="button">新建</button>
      <button id="reload-post" type="button" disabled>重新载入</button>
    </div>
    <div class="file-name-row">
      <label for="post-name">文件名</label>
      <input id="post-name" placeholder="learning-notes" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" aria-describedby="file-location" />
      <span id="file-location">.md</span>
    </div>
    <p class="editor-hint">修改顶部的标题、日期和 draft，再写正文。draft: true 的文章只保存到公开仓库。</p>
    <div class="editor-panels">
      <div class="source-panel">
        <label for="markdown-source">Markdown</label>
        <textarea id="markdown-source" spellcheck="false" aria-describedby="editor-status"></textarea>
      </div>
      <div class="preview-panel">
        <span id="preview-label">预览</span>
        <iframe id="markdown-preview" title="Markdown 文章预览" sandbox="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"></iframe>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="save-toolbar">
      <button id="save-post" type="button" disabled>保存到 GitHub</button>
      <button id="download-post" type="button">下载 Markdown</button>
      <a id="deploy-status" href={`${blog.repository}/actions/workflows/pages.yml`} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" hidden>查看发布进度</a>
    </div>
    <p id="editor-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">可先编辑和预览；保存需要连接 GitHub。</p>
    <noscript>写作页面需要启用 JavaScript。也可以在 GitHub 的网页编辑器中修改文章。</noscript>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<script>
  import '../scripts/editor';
</script>
